  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have an amd gpu with approximately quadruple the power of my old 2060, and video player framerates are in the realm of 1 frame every 3-5 seconds. I have an amd 7900xtx made by xfx with amd drivers that are up to date as of time of posting (dec, 20, 2022).\n\nreproduction:\n\n-Have amd rx7900xtx gpu installed\n\n-Have amd driver ver. Adrenalin 22.12.1\n\n-enter world with video player\n\n-play vid and observe framerate of playback\n\nAudio is perfectly fine.\n\nThank you for any input!",
